@title 3D view: front view, select a device, dimensions and clearance zone
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# Fixed 1366x768 window points: the cube front face (1295,124) and K1 (550,393) are where the front view puts them at that size. Re-aim after a layout change.
# Front view from the cube, select K1, look at its distances and the dashed free-space rectangle.
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click 23 722
wait 10
click_text Layers
wait 15
click_text "Dimensions in 3D"
wait 10
click_text Collapse
wait 10
click 1295 124
wait 40
click 550 393
wait 20
move 1000 600
wait 20
expect "Space above"
shot clearance-selected
check_layout
